+    Models matching :data:`_OPENAI_PATH_MODEL_PREFIXES` are served from ``/openai/v1``;
+    other Mantle-routed models (e.g. ``openai.gpt-oss-*``, ``google.gemma-3-*``) use ``/v1``.
